/* 8个新区域补充探索瞬间 8 × 5段 = 40段（无纯菜单Hub、1段1瞬间、双检定） */
:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
栈桥第四根石柱下的潮水坑里困着一只带铜环的信天翁，翅羽被废弃鱼线缠在牡蛎壳上。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-1">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用小刀割断缠绕鱼线 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	信天翁振翅飞向海雾，脚环铜管里掉出一枚旧港银币。<span class="green">你解救了受困的海鸟。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	信天翁受惊啄了你的手背一下，浪花也打湿了裤脚。<span class="red">手背被鸟喙啄出一道红印。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回外围通道歇脚 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按住海鸟双翼解开脚环死结 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_region_moment_foghorn_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你找准受力支点稳稳使力，手头动作一气呵成。<span class="green">事情办得干净利落，没有留下半点疏漏。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_region_moment_foghorn_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你发力时脚下微滑，手腕偏了半寸没能吃上劲。<span class="red">虎口隐隐发麻，只得先收手缓一口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
守塔人石屋外的蓄水石槽被海风刮来的海带堵住了滤网，溢出的雨水正往木门缝里渗。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if $mpClues["mp_region_moment_foghorn_1_alt"]>><span class="teal">结合先前留心记下的蛛丝马迹，你对眼前的局势更多了几分把握。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "伸手清走滤网上的墨绿海带 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	积水顺着暗槽排入大海，你在滤网底摸到一枚遗落的黄铜袖扣。<span class="green">石屋蓄水槽恢复了通畅。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_2")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰凉雨水顺着袖口倒灌进来，冻得你小臂发麻。<span class="red">冷水灌入袖口令人打颤。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖退回安全处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拔开石槽侧面的备用排水塞 (0:08)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-2">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_region_moment_foghorn_2_alt"] to 1>>
	你摸到石槽外壁的水草下有一枚备用木塞，用力拔出后积水打着旋排空。<span class="green">混着铜币的淤泥顺势留在了槽底凹坑里。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_2")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_region_moment_foghorn_2_alt"] to 1>>
备用木塞被海盐浸得发胀，你扳动时脚下一滑差点踩进水洼。<span class="red">咸涩雨水溅湿裤管，木塞仍卡在孔里。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
断桅沉船滩的肋木夹缝间，一只密封的朗姆酒木桶随退潮搁浅，桶箍铁皮已经锈断了一根。
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<if $mpClues["mp_region_moment_foghorn_2_alt"]>><span class="teal">结合先前留心记下的蛛丝马迹，你对眼前的局势更多了几分把握。</span><</if>>
