	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	齿轮带动铁钳猛晃了一下，震得你手腕生疼。<span class="red">铁钳反震令你虎口发麻。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退到通风处缓一口气 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
