	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_region_moment_clockwork_1_alt"] to 1>>
	冷不防一阵穿堂风吹来，迷了眼角也打乱了手头节奏。<span class="red">指尖在边缘滑脱，你只好先退开半步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身沿着原路退回 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
蒸汽压力室的副排水槽积了一层温水，水底铸铁格栅下闪着一枚黄铜阀门铭牌的光亮。
